      "raw": "<p>If an infected hero has died and a live infected hero exists, when plague rat has sewer fiend and would be dealt damage by an environment card, can you redirect tht damage from plague rat to the dead infected hero (not a target), thus causing it to dissipate? Or are you forced to redirect it to the live infected hero?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The card sewer fiend says:</p><p>Whenever plauge rat would be dealt damage by an environment card, redirect that damage to an infected hero.</p>",
