      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-21T04:31:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Though an incapacitated hero may be infected, that hero is not a target.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Attacks must have a target. Only cards with HPs are a target, so incapacitated heroes can not be the target of an attack.</p>",
